cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "fieldbench: open field-normalized citation benchmarking"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-09-30
repository-code: "https://github.com/nanbozhao/fieldbench"
abstract: >-
  fieldbench percentile-ranks a researcher against a transparent,
  reproducible cohort: authors active in the same OpenAlex topics,
  matched on career stage (first-publication year), with headline
  metrics drawn from Semantic Scholar. Built for evidence-grade
  research evaluation (e.g., EB-1A "final merits" field benchmarks).
